{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1221","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1221/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1221/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1221/events","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1221","id":152656693,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxNTI2NTY2OTM=","number":1221,"title":"multiple package paths can hide files in the root package","user":{"login":"janakdr","id":10134896,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM0ODk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10134896?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr","html_url":"https://github.com/janakdr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janakdr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":106503259,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDY1MDMyNTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":null},{"id":192364241,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTIzNjQyNDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/labels/P3","name":"P3","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"We're not considering working on this, but happy to review a PR. (No assignee)"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2016-05-02T22:04:49Z","updated_at":"2016-05-03T21:48:07Z","closed_at":"2016-05-03T21:48:07Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"FileSystemUtils does not consider the package with empty name when deciding if a directory can have files coming from a parent [package](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/master/src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/vfs/FileSystemUtils.java#L146) (called when planting the [link forest](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/master/src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/vfs/FileSystemUtils.java#L714)). This causes the following bug. Execute from the root of a Bazel workspace:\n\n```\necho \"sh_binary(name = 'root', srcs = ['a/root.sh'])\" >> BUILD\nmkdir -p a\ntouch a/root.sh\nchmod +x a/root.sh\nmkdir -p ../other-bazel/a/b\necho \"sh_library(name = 'b')\" >> ../other-bazel/a/b/BUILD\nbazel build //:root //a/b:b  --package_path='%workspace%:../other-bazel'\n# prints error:\nERROR: /usr/local/google/home/janakr/bazel/BUILD:53:1: 'a/root.sh' is not a file.\n\nbazel build //:root --package_path='%workspace%:../other-bazel'\n# succeeds\n\n```\n\nOne solution might be banning the package_path flag in Bazel. Getting rid of this special-casing logic might be tricky because of Google-internal issues.\n","closed_by":{"login":"bazel-io","id":15028808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io","html_url":"https://github.com/bazel-io","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1221/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}